{"t":"TPR","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Tapestry, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Luxury Goods","employees":12600,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://www.tapestry.com","summary_en":"Tapestry, Inc. provides accessories and lifestyle brand products in North America, Greater China, rest of Asia, and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Coach and Kate Spade. It offers handbags, fashion designs, business cases, computer bags, messenger style bags, backpacks, travel bags, and totes; accessories, such as small leather goods which includes mini and micro handbags, money pieces, wristlets, pouches, and cosmetic cases, as well as novelty accessories, including address books, time management and travel accessories, sketchbooks, and portfolios; and belts, key rings, technology accessories, gifting, straps, and charms. The company also provides women's and men's footwear, which casual and dress shoes, boots, sneakers, and sandals; and other products which includes outerwear, ready-to-wear, jewelry, watches, eyewear, fragrance, scarves, hats, gloves, and other products. It offers its products through retail and outlet stores, brand e-commerce sites, and concession shop-in-shops, as well as third-party digital platforms, including marketplaces. The company was formerly known as Coach, Inc. and changed its name to Tapestry, Inc. in October 2017. Tapestry, Inc. was founded in 1941 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Tapestry, Inc.는 북미, 중화권, 기타 아시아 지역 및 국제적으로 액세서리 및 라이프스타일 브랜드 제품을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 코치(Coach)와 케이트 스페이드(Kate Spade)라는 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 핸드백, 패션 디자인, 비즈니스 케이스, 컴퓨터 가방, 메신저 스타일 가방, 백팩, 여행 가방 및 토트백을 제공합니다. 미니 및 마이크로 핸드백, 머니 피스, 팔찌, 파우치 및 화장품 케이스를 포함하는 소형 가죽 제품과 같은 액세서리와 주소록, 시간 관리 및 여행 액세서리, 스케치북 및 포트폴리오를 포함한 참신한 액세서리; 벨트, 열쇠고리, 기술 액세서리, 선물, 스트랩, 참 등이 있습니다. 이 회사는 또한 캐주얼 및 정장 구두, 부츠, 운동화, 샌들 등 여성 및 남성 신발을 제공합니다. 겉옷, 기성복, 보석, 시계, 안경, 향수, 스카프, 모자, 장갑 및 기타 제품을 포함하는 기타 제품. 소매점과 아웃렛 매장, 브랜드 전자상거래 사이트, 할인점 매장은 물론 마켓플레이스를 포함한 제3자 디지털 플랫폼을 통해 제품을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Coach, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2017년 10월에 이름을 Tapestry, Inc.로 변경했습니다. Tapestry, Inc.는 1941년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":133.98,"mcap":26329278464.0,"pe":17.221079,"fpe":14.565387,"peg":1.941,"ps":3.2135525,"pb":77.04428,"ev_ebitda":14.108,"div":1.39,"beta":1.46,"hi52":164.8,"lo52":99.01},"fin":{"rev":8193200128.0,"rev_g":0.111,"eps_g":0.375,"gross":0.77135,"op":0.23674999,"net":0.19683,"roe":4.33813,"fcf":1368075008.0,"cash":782000000.0,"debt":4254000128.0,"de":1236.628,"eps":7.78,"feps":9.19852},"own":{"short":0.0861,"inst":1.03108,"insider":0.0041},"analyst":{"n":20,"mean":163.55,"median":159.5,"high":211.0,"low":96.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.77273,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":11,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":10,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":11,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":6,"buy":11,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":159.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":195.0,"priorPriceTarget":185.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":160.0,"priorPriceTarget":145.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":155.0,"priorPriceTarget":150.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTarge